<summary>
```
Called prior to adding a text component to the UI. After doing so, GRAPHICS::END_TEXT_COMMAND_SCALEFORM_STRING is called.
Examples:
GRAPHICS::BEGIN_TEXT_COMMAND_SCALEFORM_STRING("NUMBER");
